# Copy to .env (gitignored). Every setting may also come from the environment.
# The data root: renders, plates, narration, stills, caches. Keep it outside
# the checkout so a relayout or a deleted clone cannot take the renders.
BLENDERKC_HOME=~/.self-learn/blenderkc
# The topics tree: the video sources every verb reads and `new` writes
# (default: this checkout's topics/). Point it at a private topics checkout
# to keep course videos out of this repository.
# BLENDERKC_TOPICS=~/src/blenderkc-topics
# The manimkc checkout gnosia-audio reads the series voice and clip cache from
# (default: a sibling ../manimkc, which is where it sits in self-learn).
# MANIMKC_ROOT=~/src/manimkc
# Memory cap for a render on a Linux host (systemd-run scope), or none.
# BLENDERKC_MEMORY_MAX=3G
